@startuml LaPrizza-Procurement-Context-Map
title Context Map - Level 1: Backoffice and Procurement
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

rectangle "Backoffice (Web API)\n<b>Upstream Supplier</b>\nOperational catalogue, orders and stock" as Backoffice
rectangle "Procurement (Prolog)\n<b>Downstream Customer</b>\nPlanning inputs, supplier offers and calculation results" as Procurement

Backoffice --> Procurement : <b>Customer/Supplier</b>\nPlanning data contract (AI06)

note bottom of Backoffice
    Provides the operational data and agrees
    the fields required by Procurement.
end note

note bottom of Procurement
    AI06 maps the published data
    to Procurement's planning model.
end note
@enduml
